{"4659370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Elf", "steam_appid": 4659370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark-fantasy action RPG where the Elves fall first — and the last Elven blade must ride to protect the Kingdom of Men.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a collapsing world in <strong>stamina-driven real-time combat</strong>, level up by hunting monsters, and push through <strong>four story chapters</strong> toward a final breach into the Demon Lord’s realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the Last Elven Sword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in the ashes of Elfridge. Take up a fallen oath, cross the great plains on horseback, and carve a path from the human capital to the mountain peaks - and finally into a twisted land beyond the portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stamina-Based Combat That Rewards Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack, sprint, and dodge consumes stamina. Manage it well to survive harder enemies and boss fights.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time melee combat with dodge/sprint pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina is your key constraint - grow stronger as you level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy encounters escalate into major skill checks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up by Hunting Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to earn XP and increase your <strong>level, health, and stamina</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters grant <strong>different XP</strong> based on difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>respawn over time</strong>, letting you return stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level requires progressively more XP to reach</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore for Hidden Gold, Buy Better Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s <strong>one currency: Gold</strong>, earned through exploration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find coins hidden in the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend gold to buy weapons and essential upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is driven by combat and chapters - <strong>missions aren’t locked behind gold</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Chapters, Big Boss Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, story-forward structure built around memorable fights and set pieces.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 chapters</strong>, each around <strong>30 minutes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key boss encounters including a <strong>colossal golem</strong>, a <strong>dragon</strong>, and the <strong>Demon Lord</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions and NPC moments that build context and reward you with better gear</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story of Oath and Sacrifice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet survivors, earn the trust of the Kingdom of Men, climb into the dragon’s shadow, and step alone into the final breach — where the last choice may cost everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player. Story-driven. Real-time combat.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark-fantasy action RPG where the Elves fall first — and the last Elven blade must ride to protect the Kingdom of Men.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a collapsing world in <strong>stamina-driven real-time combat</strong>, level up by hunting monsters, and push through <strong>four story chapters</strong> toward a final breach into the Demon Lord’s realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the Last Elven Sword</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins in the ashes of Elfridge. Take up a fallen oath, cross the great plains on horseback, and carve a path from the human capital to the mountain peaks - and finally into a twisted land beyond the portal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stamina-Based Combat That Rewards Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack, sprint, and dodge consumes stamina. Manage it well to survive harder enemies and boss fights.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time melee combat with dodge/sprint pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina is your key constraint - grow stronger as you level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy encounters escalate into major skill checks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up by Hunting Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to earn XP and increase your <strong>level, health, and stamina</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters grant <strong>different XP</strong> based on difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>respawn over time</strong>, letting you return stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level requires progressively more XP to reach</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore for Hidden Gold, Buy Better Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s <strong>one currency: Gold</strong>, earned through exploration.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find coins hidden in the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend gold to buy weapons and essential upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is driven by combat and chapters - <strong>missions aren’t locked behind gold</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Chapters, Big Boss Moments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focused, story-forward structure built around memorable fights and set pieces.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 chapters</strong>, each around <strong>30 minutes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key boss encounters including a <strong>colossal golem</strong>, a <strong>dragon</strong>, and the <strong>Demon Lord</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions and NPC moments that build context and reward you with better gear</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story of Oath and Sacrifice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet survivors, earn the trust of the Kingdom of Men, climb into the dragon’s shadow, and step alone into the final breach — where the last choice may cost everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player. Story-driven. Real-time combat.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A dark-fantasy action RPG where the last Elven blade rides to save the Kingdom of Men. Explore for hidden gold, buy weapons, and level up by slaying demonic monsters in stamina-based combat - then face a golem, dragon, and Demon Lord across 4 chapters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659370/6532b2a234c5d456822d5f6ec7591efb1b31765c/header.jpg?t=1781504690", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659370/fb23edb628808cc15ea7867fc160e8770505ab98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781504690", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659370/fb23edb628808cc15ea7867fc160e8770505ab98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781504690", "website": "https://thelastelf.netlify.app", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 10th Gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage